WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.035
"Ne bɛna la dingɛda gɛrɛfɛ, k'a tanga benkannikɛbagaw ma".

00:00:05.115 --> 00:00:12.090
Loon o loon su, a tun b'a yɛrɛ ɲɔti k'a ɲimi fɔɔ a tun tɛ se ka dumuni kɛ tugun.

00:00:12.170 --> 00:00:16.411
O tun bɛ to ka na ni o ye fɔ waga kelen ni kelen.

00:00:16.491 --> 00:00:20.203
O tun b'a ra, o tun bɛ na ni a kɔnɔbara ye.

00:00:20.283 --> 00:00:23.819
A y'a fɔ subaga ye ko: "O ye sosow lo ye.

00:00:23.899 --> 00:00:28.933
O tun ye ɲɔgɔndan belebelebaw ye, u tun ka bon i ko faliw!
